<h1>Don Tracy</h1>
<p>United States Senate, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Republican.</p>
<p><a href="https://dontracyforil.com" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (dontracyforil.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Says he is running because the American Dream is slipping away for working families. His campaign focuses on lowering the cost of living, including housing, groceries, utilities, and healthcare, on public safety and support for law enforcement, on small business growth, and on representing all 102 Illinois counties rather than the Chicago area alone.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Attorney and business leader from Springfield; former chair of the Illinois Republican Party and former chair of the Illinois Gaming Board.</p>
